===Etymology===
/hidarikiki/: [pidarikiki] → [ɸidarikiki] → [çidarikiki]. Compound of {{compound|ja|左|tr1=hidari|t1=left|利き|tr2=kiki|t2=effective}}. {{rendaku2|kiki|giki}}

===Pronunciation===
{{ja-pron|ひだりきき|acc=0|acc_ref=DJR}}

===Noun===
{{ja-noun|ひだりきき|ひだりぎき}}

# the ability to use a left hand better than a right hand; [[left-handedness]]
# a person who can use their left hand better than their right hand; [[left-handed]] [[person]]
